{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Mechanical Chess: Real-time",
    "steam_appid": 3841280,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3841280/extras/37351a10a7a5f0a6f4a3a4e75602c664.avif?t=1753668629\" width=800 height=450 /></span>The rules of chess have been broken.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Victory is no longer decided by a single, careful move, but by split-second decisions and god-like control. Mechanical Chess is a fast and furious real-time chess that has thrown off the shackles of turn-based gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forget taking turns. In Mechanical Chess, every piece moves in real-time at your command. The strategic depth of chess collides with the intense micro-control of an RTS. Control multiple pieces at once to flank your opponent, dodge incoming attacks with lightning-fast reflexes, and shatter their king's defense before they can react.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >INTENSE REAL-TIME PVP: Forget turns, and test your mechanics against players from around the world. There is only skill.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >CHALLENGING SINGLE-PLAYER: Hone your strategies against a variety of AI opponents and conquer a series of unique campaign missions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >CLIMB THE GLOBAL LEADERBOARDS: Win matches, increase your ELO rating, and see how you stack up against the very best under your banner of Gambit Forge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >STRATEGY MEETS ACTION: Experience the timeless depth of chess fused with the adrenaline-pumping, moment-to-moment gameplay of a real-time strategy game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From solo developer Gambit Forge, this game was forged with a passion for chess and a love for action-strategy games. We look forward to seeing you on the new battlefield!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3841280/extras/37351a10a7a5f0a6f4a3a4e75602c664.avif?t=1753668629\" width=800 height=450 /></span>The rules of chess have been broken.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Victory is no longer decided by a single, careful move, but by split-second decisions and god-like control. Mechanical Chess is a fast and furious real-time chess that has thrown off the shackles of turn-based gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forget taking turns. In Mechanical Chess, every piece moves in real-time at your command. The strategic depth of chess collides with the intense micro-control of an RTS. Control multiple pieces at once to flank your opponent, dodge incoming attacks with lightning-fast reflexes, and shatter their king's defense before they can react.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >INTENSE REAL-TIME PVP: Forget turns, and test your mechanics against players from around the world. There is only skill.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >CHALLENGING SINGLE-PLAYER: Hone your strategies against a variety of AI opponents and conquer a series of unique campaign missions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >CLIMB THE GLOBAL LEADERBOARDS: Win matches, increase your ELO rating, and see how you stack up against the very best under your banner of Gambit Forge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >STRATEGY MEETS ACTION: Experience the timeless depth of chess fused with the adrenaline-pumping, moment-to-moment gameplay of a real-time strategy game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From solo developer Gambit Forge, this game was forged with a passion for chess and a love for action-strategy games. We look forward to seeing you on the new battlefield!</p>",
    "short_description": "&quot;Who wins: a chess grandmaster's strategy or a pro-gamer's reflexes?&quot; In Mechanical Chess, you need both. Shattering the old rules, we've removed turns for pure real-time battles. Your mind is the strategist, your hands are the weapon. Enter the arena and prove your mastery!",
    "supported_languages": "English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Korean, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese",
